## Schedule a recurring run
The member wants this knowledge base maintained on a schedule. Agree with the member on what to run, how often, and which agent runs it, then create a run-only automation. How to create it is in the `marvis-platform` skill, `references/autopilots.md`. In the automation's instructions, name the knowledge base `team`, say what to do, and point to `references/knowledge-bases.md`.

Do not change pages in this conversation. Reply with the automation's name and schedule.

